  "description_text": "Description: Add a bold pop of color to your Apple Watch with this transparent rugged protective case paired with a vibrant orange strap. Designed for durability and style, this case provides all-around protection against scratches, drops, and daily wear while showcasing your Apple Watch’s sleek design. The high-quality silicone strap offers a secure and comfortable fit, perfect for workouts, outdoor adventures, or everyday wear. With precise cutouts, it ensures easy access to all buttons, crown, and sensors, combining practicality with a sporty edge. ✅ Shockproof & scratch-resistant protective case ✅ Transparent body with striking orange strap ✅ Sweat-resistant & comfortable for long wear ✅ Easy to install with screw-secured frame ✅ Perfect for sports, fitness & daily use",
  "description_html": "<p>Description:<br>Add a bold pop of color to your Apple Watch with this transparent rugged protective case paired with a vibrant orange strap. Designed for durability and style, this case provides all-around protection against scratches, drops, and daily wear while showcasing your Apple Watch’s sleek design. The high-quality silicone strap offers a secure and comfortable fit, perfect for workouts, outdoor adventures, or everyday wear. With precise cutouts, it ensures easy access to all buttons, crown, and sensors, combining practicality with a sporty edge.</p>\n<p>✅ Shockproof &amp; scratch-resistant protective case<br>✅ Transparent body with striking orange strap<br>✅ Sweat-resistant &amp; comfortable for long wear<br>✅ Easy to install with screw-secured frame<br>✅ Perfect for sports, fitness &amp; daily use</p>\n<p> </p>"
